  "schema":1,"number":5,"title":"Interactive editing is not runtime ownership",
  "description":"REPLAI is a pinned, statically linked editor inside yvex chat. It returns submitted UTF-8 and generic input events, restores terminal state before dispatch, and owns no product request semantics. YVEX owns history admission, command completion decisions, attachments, generation-bound requests, cancellation and result rendering. No editable prompt coexists with generation.",
